### Addition Basket C — Volatile Foreground, Last

Basket C is the final odorant basket. Keep it closed until Baskets A and B are complete. Add each stock separately; within this basket, the most evaporation-sensitive spice and citrus materials are held to the end. Cap the source bottles promptly after every transfer.

